<!-- Bio -->
<div class="bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-200 mb-8">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-brandBlue uppercase italic mb-6">About Snowy</h2>
<div class="space-y-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">

<div class="bg-brandBlue/5 border-l-4 border-brandOrange p-5 rounded-r-xl">
<p class="text-slate-700 italic">"I am an electronics enthusiast. Whenever there is a new product on the market, I will take it to research and experience it as soon as possible. This job is also my hobby. We are willing to share the latest and most fashionable electronic products with friends all over the world and experience the fun together."</p>
</div>

<p>Snowy May is the Founder and Marketing Manager of <a href="/about/" class="text-brandOrange hover:underline">WOWOHCOOL</a> (Dong Yi Technology Co., Ltd) and KEEPWIRELESS, with over 10 years of hands-on experience in the mobile consumer electronics industry. What started as a personal obsession with taking apart and understanding every new gadget on the market has grown into two companies that serve brands and distributors worldwide.</p>

<p>Snowy's core philosophy is simple: <strong>from design to production to finished product shipment, the client shouldn't have to worry about anything.</strong> He has accumulated over 50 successful projects for global clients — taking product ideas from napkin sketches to mass production, coordinating internal resources, and ensuring every unit ships on time and to spec. His deep knowledge of market trends means he doesn't just build what clients ask for — he recommends the products with the most market potential and the highest consumer appeal.</p>

<p>WOWOHCOOL's main business covers mobile power supplies, car jump starter power supplies, car chargers, and EV charging guns. KEEPWIRELESS focuses on wireless chargers, wireless charging car mounts, and multi-functional wireless charging stations. Together, they form a complete ecosystem of charging solutions for brands targeting retail, automotive, and hospitality channels.</p>
</div>
</div>

